  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DSB - General Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Allocation to The Norwegian Directorate for Civil Protection (DSB) over the Ministry of Foreign Affairs&#x2019; budget, for tasks DSB is to manage related to humanitarian assistance. DSB is responsible for the core concepts for international operational activities in support of humanitarian efforts. This includes the Norwegian UNDAC Support (NUS), the Norwegian Support Team (NST), UNDAC experts, EU experts and Medevac experts, as well as other liaisons. Furthermore, DSB follows up the International Search and Rescue Advisory Group (INSARAG), as well as the follow-up of civil&#x2013;military coordination in humanitarian operations under UN OCHA (UN CMCoord). The appropriation also covers the MFA&#x2019;s share of Norway&#x2019;s membership contribution to the UCPM, and Medevac for Gaza and North Macedonia.</narrative>
  </description>
